{
  "description": "Relay sequencer for a 4-channel relay board on a 5 V power bank. Switches loads on ONE AT A TIME (staggered by STAG ms, lowest rank first: CH2, CH3, CH1, CH4), sheds the least important load when the 5 V rail sags, latches EMERGENCY on a critical rail, and implements MODE 0=ACTIVE, 1=SLEEP, 2=EMERGENCY. PINx = level to write to the relay input (inverted when ACTLOW). RAIL: 0 unknown, 1 ok, 2 sag, 3 critical.",
  "nodes": [
